WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:05.800
Beast sat up and stared.

2
00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:09.615
Something strange was happening to Beast.

3
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:13.220
His fangs melted away.

4
00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:17.217
His terrible claws disappeared.

5
00:00:17.218 --> 00:00:20.038
Beauty was stunned.

6
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:25.360
Beast was changing into a young man!

7
00:00:25.361 --> 00:00:30.046
Beauty gasped. "I don't believe it."

8
00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:39.080
"Why, you're . . . you're the prince again!"

9
00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:45.922
He smiled. "You broke the curse, Beauty."

10
00:00:45.923 --> 00:00:48.769
The prince kissed her hand.

11
00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.612
"Thank you for saying you loved me.

12
00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:58.196
I release you. Go home to your father."

13
00:00:58.197 --> 00:01:01.329
"But . . ." Beauty was hurt.

14
00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.553
"Why are you sending me away?"

15
00:01:04.554 --> 00:01:08.554
"You can't truly love me," the prince said.

16
00:01:08.555 --> 00:01:15.406
"I act like a beast!"

17
00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:21.856
Beauty nodded. "That's true.

18
00:01:21.857 --> 00:01:25.813
But you also protected me.

19
00:01:25.814 --> 00:01:32.600
You showed great kindness to Father and me."

20
00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:45.605
The prince told Beauty about the fairy's curse.

21
00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:49.112
He pointed to Deer and the birds.

22
00:01:49.113 --> 00:01:54.243
"True love from you would save them too."

23
00:01:54.244 --> 00:02:03.203
"I do love you truly," Beauty said.

24
00:02:03.204 --> 00:02:06.925
The prince looked deep into her eyes.

25
00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:16.788
"And I love you truly."

26
00:02:16.789 --> 00:02:21.433
Poof! Deer disappeared.

27
00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:24.806
In her place stood the queen.

28
00:02:24.807 --> 00:02:29.624
Beauty bowed. "Your Majesty!"

29
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:34.499
Poof! The birds changed into people too.

30
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.731
They were now the castle's servants.

31
00:02:37.732 --> 00:02:40.722
They all jumped for joy.

32
00:02:40.723 --> 00:02:44.812
"We're free of the curse!" a woman cried.

33
00:02:44.813 --> 00:02:51.429
"Thank you, Beauty!"

34
00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:57.112
Weeks later, Fairy flew to the castle.

35
00:02:57.113 --> 00:03:04.813
She saw music, food, and laughter.

36
00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:07.959
Everyone was dancing.

37
00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.951
Then the prince stood up, holding a cup.

38
00:03:10.952 --> 00:03:14.646
"I'd like to make a toast," he said.

39
00:03:14.647 --> 00:03:17.768
"To Beauty, my new wife.

40
00:03:17.769 --> 00:03:21.486
And to love!"

41
00:03:21.487 --> 00:03:24.882
The room filled with cheers.

42
00:03:24.883 --> 00:03:28.930
Fairy looked at the bride and groom.

43
00:03:28.931 --> 00:03:36.443
Her curse made things hard for them.

44
00:03:36.444 --> 00:03:43.516
"But this . . . ," Fairy thought.

45
00:03:43.517 --> 00:03:51.109
"This is a happy and loving ending!"

